# Normalize line endings on checkin, keep them as LF in the working tree regardless of the
# checking-out platform's own git config (core.autocrlf) — the repo has contributors/CI on
# both Windows and Unix, and unpinned line endings turn into diff noise the moment either side
# touches a file the other created.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled binary — never line-ending-normalized (would corrupt it) and not worth a text diff
# either. Defensive: .exe is gitignored everywhere in this repo except two paths, and even
# those are Cargo build output copied in at runtime (see AppPaths::ensure_builtin_plugin_
# binaries()), never committed — but if that ever changes, this is still the right rule.
*.exe binary
